# Component Patterns

## Brand Element Cards

- Every brand element card must use `ElementWrapper` as its outer container (from `brand-cards/ElementWrapper.tsx`). The old `CardWrapper` has been deleted.
- Variation visual state is represented by `VariationState`: `"inactive" | "active" | "waiting" | "merging" | "available" | "uploading"`. Do not invent new states.
- Variation overlay UI uses `VariationStateOverlay` (from `brand-cards/VariationStateOverlay.tsx`).

## File Organization

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| Custom hooks | `src/app/hooks/` — one hook per file, named `use*.ts` |
| Utility functions | `src/app/utils/` |
| Type definitions | `src/app/types/` |
| UI primitives | `src/app/components/ui/` (shadcn/ui) — do NOT create new base UI components here |
| Board sub-components | `src/app/components/curation-board/` |
| Card sub-components | `src/app/components/brand-cards/` |

## Large File Discipline

Several files exceed 700 lines (`direction-page.tsx`, `useBrandGeneration.ts`, `App.tsx`). When modifying files over 500 lines:

1. Extract new logic into a dedicated hook or utility instead of adding more code inline
2. If a component grows beyond 400 lines, split it into sub-components in the same directory

## UI Components

Use existing shadcn/ui components from `src/app/components/ui/` (Button, Dialog, Popover, Tooltip, etc.). Do not install new UI libraries or create custom base components for things shadcn already provides.
